WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.341
Hands-only default.

00:00:01.341 --> 00:00:10.302
A rescuer who is untrained, unable or unwilling to give ventilations should provide continuous high-quality chest compressions.

00:00:10.302 --> 00:00:19.969
A trained, able and willing rescuer may use 30 compressions to 2 breaths, with each breath over one second while watching for chest rise.
